{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5c4edf1094bd468ed253aaf85e8c753706c2126d2b0e442817953bde4d267ec",
      "text": "音乐节目收录当天",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3631eec7db1ac70e0335d3b85882dae9abd79acdf3a0d44db283670d9ff979f",
      "text": "（终于到了收录当天。……可是，\n现场的各位似乎都有些无精打采）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9eae946edd528cbb1c3a664901667d2d2d50287db82429265be1c5326076eee1",
      "text": "（虽然听说过这个音乐节目面临存续危机的\n传闻，是因为那个缘故吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcc85a1fd9988c091c3e0400087e1dcfeb83a51b322139b9732a57fc172457d0",
      "text": "好的，接下来是Live部分的彩排呢。\n我这就去准备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:450205ea92ede4ea22cf2d704ab3e0c5efe3e62c6c14b04d650727e3f504b541",
      "text": "……快看，那群靠噱头出位的315 Pro\n好像要开始彩排了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7ca6e622b12c62662137cbf9034df5434ba1851f6415a4057f07ad8d429c2ed",
      "text": "哦，你们是同台出演的……\n我们是F-LAGS，今天请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39aea079eb11608041aca4d76163b302f068ccaf81dfad9b655a6fde0fb2c820",
      "text": "哈哈，同台？别把我们相提并论啊。\n我们可是名正言顺的正经偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18c7b2dba97178271ff786c4d528356f94fd567a698899ebb2f7234240f092a7",
      "text": "嗯？“名正言顺”是什么意思啊？\n我们跟你们一样也是偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:346892991734bbb12eb153b220656ee65c6d35104e619f486981a10c637d1b61",
      "text": "反正只要改变主意了就会辞掉偶像吧？\n我们可知道你们根本不是认真的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:593fe00b67fae4b03fd63cecd0dfc39e4ffe21d3a9eb07ef9f9fab45e990b18e",
      "text": "喂——！\n大吾君、一希先生，彩排要开始了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a75ebccb9d874fda661bee78f1008b036f1ec86157d145771efd5d7cc4181d88",
      "text": "哦，这就来！抱歉啊，\n话说到一半就先失陪了。老师，我们走！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7512d263abc57e5411cc932007505735b770d176d5d66060e8674bf7aa5ff2f1",
      "text": "…嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
